{% comment %}
==========================================================================
  SHEENE - Product page (slider, body, goes well with)
==========================================================================

  Snippet ka naam:  sheene-product-page
  Ingredients aur Results ab alag file mein hain:  sheene-product-extras

  PAGE PAR CALLS
  --------------
    1. Right column (Slider/Body block):
         {% render 'sheene-product-page' %}
       Slider + expert quote (slider ke neeche) + tags, title, rating,
       price, intro, benefits, delivery, perks, variants.

    2. Buy buttons ke neeche:
         {% render 'sheene-product-page', part: 'goes_well' %}

    3. Product section ke neeche alag section (doosri file):
         {% render 'sheene-product-extras' %}

  Chahiye to 'slider' aur 'body' alag bhi chal jate hain.
  Har cheez khud check karti hai: admin mein data hai to dikhegi, warna hide.

  EXPERT QUOTE
    EXPERT_UNDER_SLIDER = true          desktop par slider ke theek neeche.
                                        Left column sticky rehta hai: lamba
                                        ho to pehle scroll, phir bottom par
                                        chipak jata hai.
    EXPERT_MOBILE_UNDER_SLIDER = false  mobile par slider ke neeche nahi;
                                        extras file mobile par usay apne top
                                        par dikhati hai, taake title aur price
                                        upar rahen. true = mobile par bhi
                                        slider ke neeche (tab extras file mein
                                        SHOW_EXPERT_MOBILE = false karo).

  ADMIN: PRODUCT METAFIELDS (namespace custom)
  --------------------------------------------
    pp_badges           List of single line text   Tags. Text | color | icon
                        color: neutral, blue, yellow, purple, green, pink,
                        orange, dark, ya hex (#A98BDE ya #FAF6C8/#2F5E8C)
                        icon: truck, check, sparkle, drop, leaf
    pp_subtitle         Single line text           "Includes 5 Products"
    sold_count          Integer                    Asli units sold
    pp_intro            Rich text                  Price ke neeche text
    pp_benefits         List of single line text   Check wali pills
    goes_well_products  List of product refs       Goes Well With
    pp_refer_products   List of product refs       Bhara ho to Goes Well ki
                                                   jagah "We recommend instead"
    pp_refer_heading    Single line text           optional
    pp_refer_note       Single line text           optional
    expert_quote        Metaobject ref > expert_quote (single ya list,
                        list ho to pehli entry). pp_expert bhi chalega.

  ADMIN: METAOBJECT
    expert_quote     name, credentials, quote (multi line), photo (image)

  PERKS ROW
  ---------
  Ek card: upar progress bar + "Rs.X away from <agla reward>", neeche do
  rewards ki rows (Free Delivery, Testers) aur ek "You're saving Rs X on this
  product" row (compare-at price minus price, x quantity; bachat na ho to hide), har row green (unlocked) ya red (Add Rs.X more). Card ke
  neeche trust row (COD, Dermatologist, Returns). Threshold 0 ho to
  hamesha green ("On all orders").
  Product page par hisaab IS PRODUCT ki price x quantity se hota hai, cart
  se nahi. Variant ya quantity badlo to card khud update.
  Cart drawer / cart page wala card alag snippet hai: sheene-cart-perks.
  Thresholds dono files mein same rakhna.

  TRUST ROW (perks card ke neeche, jenpharm jaisi)
  ---------
  Cash on Delivery, Dermatologist, Easy Returns. Har item: icon + bold
  title (peeche halka marker) + chhota subtitle. Mobile par icon upar.
    TRUST_*_TITLE / TRUST_*_SUB   text
    SHOW_DERMATOLOGIST            false = sirf COD aur Returns (2 columns)
    TRUST_MARK_COLOR              title ke peeche marker ka rang

  SLIDER (jenpharm jaisa)
  ------
  Desktop: left mein thumbnails ka column, right mein bari image, round
  arrows, aur neeche right corner mein zoom button. Mobile: image upar,
  thumbnails ki row neeche, arrows band (swipe chalta hai). Zoom button ya
  image dabao to full screen view khulta hai: click se 2x zoom, mouse ya
  ungli se pan, Esc ya X se band. Image par koi label nahi.
    SHOW_THUMBS        false = thumbnails ki jagah purane dots
    THUMB_SIZE         desktop thumbnail (left column ki width)
    THUMB_SIZE_MOBILE  mobile thumbnail
    THUMB_GAP / THUMB_RADIUS / GALLERY_RADIUS   spacing aur corners
    IMAGE_FIT          contain = poori image dikhe (default)
                       cover = frame bhar de, non-square images crop hongi
    SHOW_ZOOM / ZOOM_SCALE   zoom on/off aur kitna bara
  LCP: page khulte hi jo image dikhti hai (selected variant ki, warna
  pehli) wo eager + fetchpriority high + preload. Baaki slides aur saare
  thumbnails lazy. Ye mat hatana, TikTok traffic ka LCP isi se theek hua.

  ESTIMATED DELIVERY
  ------------------
  Light timeline card (Purchased > Processing > Delivered).
    DELIVERY_MIN_DAYS / MAX_DAYS   delivery window, aaj se kitne din
    ETA_PROCESS_DAYS               processing kitne din
    ETA_CUTOFF_HOUR                is ghante tak order = aaj ka order
  Sab Karachi time par, har 30 second update.

  REVIEW STARS
  ------------
  Judge.me (reviews.rating) ya Loox. Click Judge.me widget tak le jata hai.
{% endcomment %}


{% liquid
  assign part = part | default: 'all'
  assign product = product | default: closest.product

  # ================= BODY / SLIDER =================
  # SAFE_MODE = true: sticky JS band. Debug ke liye.
  assign SAFE_MODE = false

  assign GALLERY_RATIO = '1 / 1'
  assign MEDIA_WIDTH = '52%'
  assign MAX_WIDTH = '1240px'
  assign COLUMN_GAP = '48px'
  assign STICKY_MEDIA = true

  # ---- slider design (jenpharm jaisa) ----
  assign SHOW_THUMBS = true
  assign THUMB_SIZE = '92px'
  assign THUMB_SIZE_MOBILE = '62px'
  assign THUMB_GAP = '12px'
  assign THUMB_RADIUS = '12px'
  assign GALLERY_RADIUS = '20px'
  assign IMAGE_FIT = 'contain'
  assign SHOW_ZOOM = true
  assign ZOOM_SCALE = 2.2

  assign VARIANT_BOX_TITLE = 'Choose variants'
  assign OPTION_LABEL_PREFIX = 'Select'
  assign PILL_RADIUS = '4px'

  assign HIDE_ARROWS_MOBILE = true
  assign MOBILE_GALLERY_GAP = '1.75rem'

  assign SHOW_EMPTY_STATE = false
  assign REVIEWS_ANCHOR = '#judgeme_product_reviews'

  assign TAG_RADIUS = '8px'
  assign STAR_COLOR = '#F2C230'
  assign SHOW_REVIEW_COUNT = true
  assign SOLD_MIN = 1
  assign SOLD_SUFFIX = 'Sold'

  # ---- perks: thresholds PKR mein ----
  assign FREE_DELIVERY_MIN = 2500
  assign TESTERS_MIN = 2500

  assign FREE_DELIVERY_LABEL = 'Free Delivery'
  assign TESTERS_LABEL = 'Free 5 ml tester 2 bottles'
  assign SAVE_TEXT_BEFORE = "You're saving"
  assign SAVE_TEXT_AFTER = 'on this product'
  assign SAVE_PILL = 'Nice!'
  assign PERK_MET_TEXT = 'Unlocked'
  assign PERK_ALWAYS_TEXT = 'On all orders'
  assign PERKS_AWAY_TEXT = 'away from'
  assign PERKS_ALL_TEXT = 'All rewards unlocked with this product'

  # ---- trust row (perks card ke neeche) ----
  assign TRUST_COD_TITLE = 'Cash on Delivery'
  assign TRUST_COD_SUB = 'pay when it arrives'
  assign SHOW_DERMATOLOGIST = true
  assign TRUST_DERM_TITLE = 'Dermatologist'
  assign TRUST_DERM_SUB = 'trusted brand'
  assign TRUST_RETURNS_TITLE = 'Easy Returns'
  assign TRUST_RETURNS_SUB = '3 days'
  assign TRUST_MARK_COLOR = '#E7E5DE'

  assign COLOR_MET = '#2E7D4F'
  assign COLOR_UNMET = '#C0392B'

  # ---- delivery estimate ----
  assign SHOW_DELIVERY = true
  assign DELIVERY_MIN_DAYS = 2
  assign DELIVERY_MAX_DAYS = 4
  assign ETA_CUTOFF_HOUR = 24
  assign ETA_PROCESS_DAYS = 1
  assign ETA_STEP_1 = 'Purchased'
  assign ETA_STEP_2 = 'Processing'
  assign ETA_STEP_3 = 'Delivered'

  # ================= GOES WELL / REFER =================
  assign GWW_HEADING = 'Goes well with'
  assign REFER_HEADING = 'We recommend instead'
  assign REFER_BUTTON = 'View product'
  assign ADD_TEXT = 'Add to cart'
  assign SELECT_TEXT = 'Select size'
  assign SOLD_OUT_TEXT = 'Sold out'
  assign MAX_ITEMS = 7


  # ================= EXPERT QUOTE =================
  assign EXPERT_UNDER_SLIDER = true
  assign EXPERT_MOBILE_UNDER_SLIDER = false
%}

{% comment %} ================================================================
     EXPERT QUOTE (ek dafa banta hai, slider ke neeche ya extras mein lagta hai)
   ================================================================ {% endcomment %}
{% assign expert_html = '' %}
{% if part == 'slider' or part == 'all' %}
  {% liquid
    assign ex_field = product.metafields.custom.pp_expert
    if ex_field == blank
      assign ex_field = product.metafields.custom.expert_quote
    endif
    assign ex = nil
    if ex_field.type contains 'list.'
      for e in ex_field.value limit: 1
        assign ex = e
      endfor
    else
      assign ex = ex_field.value
    endif
  %}
  {% if ex != blank and ex.quote.value != blank %}
    {% capture expert_html %}
      <figure class="sh-expert">
        {% if ex.photo.value != blank %}
          {% assign ex_alt = ex.name.value | escape %}
          <div class="sh-expert__photo">
            {{ ex.photo.value | image_url: width: 200 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: ex_alt }}
          </div>
        {% endif %}
        <span class="sh-expert__mark" aria-hidden="true">&rdquo;</span>
        <div>
          <blockquote class="sh-expert__quote">{{ ex.quote.value | escape | newline_to_br }}</blockquote>
          {% if ex.name.value != blank %}
            <figcaption class="sh-expert__by">
              {{ ex.name.value | escape }}
              {% if ex.credentials.value != blank %}<span class="sh-expert__cred">{{ ex.credentials.value | escape }}</span>{% endif %}
            </figcaption>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      </figure>
    {% endcapture %}
    <style>
  .sh-expert {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.1rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
    margin: 0;
    padding: clamp(1.25rem, 1rem + 1vw, 2rem);
    background: #F7F7F5;
    border-radius: 16px;
    font-family: var(--font-body--family, system-ui, sans-serif);
    color: var(--color-foreground, #111111);
  }
  .sh-expert__photo {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    width: clamp(64px, 56px + 2vw, 88px);
    height: clamp(64px, 56px + 2vw, 88px);
    border-radius: 50%;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #E8E8E5;
  }
  .sh-expert__photo img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block; }
  .sh-expert__mark {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0.75rem;
    right: 1.1rem;
    font-size: 3rem;
    line-height: 1;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: rgb(var(--color-foreground-rgb, 17 17 17) / 0.12);
  }
  .sh-expert__quote {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(0.95rem, 0.9rem + 0.2vw, 1.05rem);
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: rgb(var(--color-foreground-rgb, 17 17 17) / 0.82);
  }
  .sh-expert__by { margin: 0.9rem 0 0; font-weight: 600; font-size: clamp(0.9rem, 0.86rem + 0.15vw, 1rem); }
  .sh-expert__cred { display: block; font-weight: 400; font-size: 0.88em; color: rgb(var(--color-foreground-rgb, 17 17 17) / 0.65); margin-top: 0.15rem; }
  .sh-expert-wrap { display: grid; gap: 1.5rem; align-items: start; }
  @media (min-width: 750px) {
    .sh-expert-wrap--split { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: clamp(1.5rem, 1rem + 2vw, 3rem); }
  }
  .sh-gallery-expert { margin-top: 1.5rem; }
  {% unless EXPERT_MOBILE_UNDER_SLIDER %}
  @media (max-width: 749px) { .sh-gallery-expert { display: none; } }
  {% endunless %}
  @media (min-width: 750px) { .sh-expert-mobile { display: none; } }
</style>
  {% endif %}
{% endif %}

{% assign sticky_on = STICKY_MEDIA %}

{% comment %} ================================================================
     SLIDER + BODY
   ================================================================ {% endcomment %}
{% if part == 'slider' or part == 'body' or part == 'all' %}
<style>
  .sh-gallery {
    width: 100%;
    --sh-gallery-ratio: {{ GALLERY_RATIO }};
    --sh-gallery-fit: {{ IMAGE_FIT }};
    --sh-gallery-radius: {{ GALLERY_RADIUS }};
    --sh-thumb-size: {{ THUMB_SIZE_MOBILE }};
    --sh-thumb-gap: {{ THUMB_GAP }};
    --sh-thumb-radius: {{ THUMB_RADIUS }};
    --sh-thumb-line: rgb(var(--color-foreground-rgb, 17 17 17) / 0.12);
  }

  /* stage = bari image + thumbnails. Mobile: image upar, thumbs neeche.
     Desktop (neeche media query): thumbs left column mein. */
  .sh-gallery-stage {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    grid-template-areas: "main";
    gap: var(--sh-thumb-gap);
  }
  .sh-gallery-stage--thumbs { grid-template-areas: "main" "thumbs"; }

  .sh-gallery-viewport {
    grid-area: main;
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: var(--sh-gallery-ratio);
    overflow: hidden;
    isolation: isolate;
    background: #F7F7F5;
    border-radius: var(--sh-gallery-radius);
    touch-action: pan-y;
    overscroll-behavior-x: contain;
  }

  .sh-gallery-track {
    display: flex;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    transition: transform 0.4s var(--ease-out-quad, cubic-bezier(0.32, 0.72, 0, 1));
  }

  .sh-gallery-slide {
    flex: 0 0 100%;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .sh-gallery-empty { background: rgb(var(--color-foreground-rgb, 17 17 17) / 0.04); }

  .sh-gallery-media,
  .sh-gallery-media video,
  .sh-gallery-media model-viewer {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: var(--sh-gallery-fit);
    display: block;
  }
  {%- if SHOW_ZOOM %}
  img.sh-gallery-media { cursor: zoom-in; }
  {%- endif %}

  .sh-gallery-media--embed { position: relative; width: 100%; height: 100%; }
  .sh-gallery-media--embed iframe { width: 100%; height: 100%; border: 0; }

  /* round white buttons: arrows + zoom */
  .sh-gallery-arrow,
  .sh-gallery-zoom {
    position: absolute;
    z-index: 1;
    width: 2.75rem;
    height: 2.75rem;
    padding: 0;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--color-background, #FFFFFF);
    color: var(--color-foreground, #111111);
    box-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1);
    cursor: pointer;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    transition: box-shadow var(--animation-speed, 0.15s) ease;
  }
  .sh-gallery-arrow:hover,
  .sh-gallery-zoom:hover { box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.16); }
  .sh-gallery-arrow:focus-visible,
  .sh-gallery-zoom:focus-visible {
    outline: var(--focus-outline-width, 2px) solid var(--color-foreground, #111111);
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }
  .sh-gallery-arrow svg,
  .sh-gallery-zoom svg { width: 1.25rem; height: 1.25rem; display: block; }
  .sh-gallery-arrow { top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%); }
  .sh-gallery-arrow--prev { left: 1rem; }
  .sh-gallery-arrow--next { right: 1rem; }
  .sh-gallery-zoom { right: 1rem; bottom: 1rem; cursor: zoom-in; }
  .sh-gallery-zoom[hidden] { display: none; }

  /* ---------- thumbnails ---------- */
  .sh-gallery-thumbs-wrap { grid-area: thumbs; min-width: 0; }
  .sh-gallery-thumbs {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--sh-thumb-gap);
    overflow-x: auto;
    overscroll-behavior-x: contain;
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
    scrollbar-width: none;
  }
  .sh-gallery-thumbs::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
  .sh-gallery-thumb {
    position: relative;
    flex: 0 0 var(--sh-thumb-size);
    width: var(--sh-thumb-size);
    aspect-ratio: var(--sh-gallery-ratio);
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    border: 0;
    border-radius: var(--sh-thumb-radius);
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #FFFFFF;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .sh-gallery-thumb img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: var(--sh-gallery-fit);
    display: block;
  }
  .sh-gallery-thumb::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    border: 1px solid var(--sh-thumb-line);
    border-radius: inherit;
    pointer-events: none;
    transition: border-color var(--animation-speed, 0.15s) ease;
  }
  .sh-gallery-thumb:hover::after { border-color: rgb(var(--color-foreground-rgb, 17 17 17) / 0.35); }
  .sh-gallery-thumb.is-active::after {
    border: 2px solid var(--color-foreground, #111111);
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 2px var(--color-background, #FFFFFF);
  }
  .sh-gallery-thumb:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--color-foreground, #111111);
    outline-offset: -5px;
  }
  .sh-gallery-thumb__play {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    width: 1.75rem;
    height: 1.75rem;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.92);
    color: var(--color-foreground, #111111);
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .sh-gallery-thumb__play svg { width: 0.75rem; height: 0.75rem; display: block; fill: currentColor; }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .sh-gallery { --sh-thumb-size: {{ THUMB_SIZE }}; }
    .sh-gallery-stage--thumbs {
      grid-template-columns: var(--sh-thumb-size) minmax(0, 1fr);
      grid-template-areas: "thumbs main";
      gap: 1rem;
    }
    /* thumbs column ki height = bari image ki height; zyada thumbs hon to andar scroll */
    .sh-gallery-stage--thumbs .sh-gallery-thumbs-wrap { position: relative; }
    .sh-gallery-stage--thumbs .sh-gallery-thumbs {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      flex-direction: column;
      overflow-x: hidden;
      overflow-y: auto;
      overscroll-behavior-y: contain;
    }
    .sh-gallery-stage--thumbs .sh-gallery-thumb { flex: 0 0 auto; width: 100%; }
  }

  .sh-gallery-dots {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--gap-xs, 0.5rem);
    margin-top: var(--margin-lg, 1rem);
  }

  .sh-gallery-dot {
    width: 0.5rem;
    height: 0.5rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 1px solid rgb(var(--color-foreground-rgb, 17 17 17) / 0.35);
    background: transparent;
    padding: 0;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background var(--animation-speed, 0.15s) ease;
  }
  .sh-gallery-dot.is-active {
    background: var(--color-foreground, #111111);
    border-color: var(--color-foreground, #111111);
  }
  {%- if SHOW_ZOOM %}

  /* ---------- full screen zoom ---------- */
  html:has(dialog.sh-zoom[open]) { overflow: hidden; }
  dialog.sh-zoom {
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    max-width: none;
    max-height: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    border: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    overscroll-behavior: contain;
    background: var(--color-background, #FFFFFF);
    color: var(--color-foreground, #111111);
  }
  dialog.sh-zoom::backdrop { background: rgb(17 17 17 / 0.4); }
  .sh-zoom__stage {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 4rem 1rem 3.5rem;
    overflow: hidden;
    touch-action: pinch-zoom;
  }
  /* khulte hi focus stage par jata hai (close button par ring nahi), Tab se buttons */
  .sh-zoom__stage:focus { outline: none; }
  .sh-zoom__img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: contain;
    display: block;
    cursor: zoom-in;
    transform-origin: 50% 50%;
    transition: transform 0.25s ease;
    user-select: none;
    -webkit-user-select: none;
    -webkit-user-drag: none;
  }
  dialog.sh-zoom.is-zoomed .sh-zoom__img { transform: scale({{ ZOOM_SCALE }}); cursor: zoom-out; }
  dialog.sh-zoom.is-zoomed .sh-zoom__stage { touch-action: none; }
  .sh-zoom__btn {
    position: absolute;
    z-index: 1;
    width: 2.75rem;
    height: 2.75rem;
    padding: 0;
    border: 0;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #F7F7F5;
    color: var(--color-foreground, #111111);
    cursor: pointer;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    transition: background var(--animation-speed, 0.15s) ease;
  }
  .sh-zoom__btn:hover { background: #ECEBE6; }
  .sh-zoom__btn:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--color-foreground, #111111);
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }
  .sh-zoom__btn svg { width: 1.25rem; height: 1.25rem; display: block; }
  .sh-zoom__close { top: 0.75rem; right: 0.75rem; }
  .sh-zoom__nav { top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%); }
  .sh-zoom__nav--prev { left: 1rem; }
  .sh-zoom__nav--next { right: 1rem; }
  .sh-zoom__count {
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 1.1rem;
    margin: 0;
    text-align: center;
    font-family: var(--font-body--family, system-ui, sans-serif);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    color: rgb(var(--color-foreground-rgb, 17 17 17) / 0.6);
  }
  dialog.sh-zoom.sh-zoom--single .sh-zoom__nav,
  dialog.sh-zoom.sh-zoom--single .sh-zoom__count { display: none; }
  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .sh-zoom__stage { inset: 4rem 5.5rem 3.5rem; }
  }
  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .sh-zoom__nav { display: none; }
    .sh-zoom__stage { inset: 3.75rem 0 3.25rem; }
  }
  {%- endif %}

  /* ---------- info column ---------- */
  .sh-pdp {
    --sh-gap: var(--margin-lg, 1rem);
    --sh-muted: rgb(var(--color-foreground-rgb, 17 17 17) / var(--opacity-muted-text, 0.6));
    --sh-line: rgb(var(--color-foreground-rgb, 17 17 17) / 0.22);
    --sh-hair: rgb(var(--color-border-rgb, 17 17 17) / 0.14);
    --sh-ok: {{ COLOR_MET }};
    --sh-no: {{ COLOR_UNMET }};

    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    text-align: left;
    width: 100%;
    font-family: var(--font-body--family, system-ui, sans-serif);
    color: var(--color-foreground, #111111);
  }
  .sh-pdp > * { margin: 0; }
  .sh-pdp > * + * { margin-top: var(--sh-gap); }

  /* ---------- tags ---------- */
  .sh-tags {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
  }
  .sh-pdp > .sh-tags + .sh-title { margin-top: 0.85rem; }

  .sh-tag {
    --sh-tag-bg: #F2F2F0;
    --sh-tag-fg: var(--color-foreground, #111111);
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5em;
    padding: 0.5em 0.95em;
    border-radius: {{ TAG_RADIUS }};
    background: var(--sh-tag-bg);
    color: var(--sh-tag-fg);
    font-family: var(--font-body--family, system-ui, sans-serif);
    font-style: var(--font-body--style, normal);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: clamp(0.8rem, 0.76rem + 0.15vw, 0.9rem);
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .sh-tag--blue    { --sh-tag-bg: #E3EEFB; --sh-tag-fg: #2F5E8C; }
  .sh-tag--yellow  { --sh-tag-bg: #FAF6C8; --sh-tag-fg: #6B5A0E; }
  .sh-tag--purple  { --sh-tag-bg: #A98BDE; --sh-tag-fg: #FFFFFF; }
  .sh-tag--green   { --sh-tag-bg: #E1F2EA; --sh-tag-fg: #2F6B55; }
  .sh-tag--pink    { --sh-tag-bg: #FBE4EA; --sh-tag-fg: #8C3450; }
  .sh-tag--orange  { --sh-tag-bg: #FCE9DB; --sh-tag-fg: #8A4618; }
  .sh-tag--dark    { --sh-tag-bg: var(--color-foreground, #111111); --sh-tag-fg: var(--color-background, #FFFFFF); }

  .sh-tag__icon { display: block; width: 1.25em; height: 1.25em; flex: 0 0 auto; }
  .sh-tag__icon svg,
  .sh-ico svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    display: block;
    fill: none;
    stroke: currentColor;
    stroke-width: 1.8px;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
  }

  /* ---------- title / subtitle ---------- */
  .sh-title {
    font-family: var(--font-h1--family, var(--font-heading--family, system-ui, sans-serif));
    font-style: var(--font-h1--style, normal);
    font-weight: var(--font-h1--weight, 700);
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 1.2rem + 1.4vw, 2.5rem);
    line-height: var(--font-h1--line-height, 1.15);
    letter-spacing: var(--font-h1--letter-spacing, -0.02em);
    text-transform: var(--font-h1--case, none);
    color: var(--color-foreground, #111111);
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .sh-pdp > .sh-title + .sh-meta,
  .sh-pdp > .sh-title + .sh-subtitle,
  .sh-pdp > .sh-meta + .sh-subtitle,
  .sh-pdp > .sh-subtitle + .sh-meta { margin-top: 0.6rem; }

  .sh-subtitle {
    font-size: clamp(0.9rem, 0.86rem + 0.15vw, 1rem);
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: var(--sh-muted);
  }

  /* ---------- rating + sold ---------- */
  .sh-meta {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.35rem 0.75rem;
    font-weight: var(--font-body--weight, 400);
    font-size: clamp(0.95rem, 0.9rem + 0.2vw, 1.05rem);
    line-height: 1;
    color: var(--sh-muted);
  }
  .sh-rating {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .sh-rating:hover .sh-rating-value { text-decoration: underline; }
  .sh-rating-stars {
    position: relative;
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 1.35em;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .sh-rating-stars-bg { color: var(--sh-line); }
  .sh-rating-stars-fg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    width: var(--sh-rating, 0%);
    color: {{ STAR_COLOR }};
  }
  .sh-sold { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.75rem; }
  .sh-sold__sep {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 1px;
    height: 1.05em;
    background: currentColor;
    opacity: 0.6;
  }

  /* ---------- price ---------- */
  .sh-price {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--gap-sm, 0.7rem);
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .sh-price-compare {
    color: var(--sh-muted);
    text-decoration: line-through;
    font-size: var(--font-size--md, 1rem);
  }
  .sh-price-current {
    color: var(--color-foreground, #111111);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: var(--font-size--xl, 1.25rem);
  }
  .sh-price-badge {
    background: var(--color-foreground, #111111);
    color: var(--color-background, #FFFFFF);
    font-size: var(--font-size--2xs, 0.75rem);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: var(--letter-spacing-sm, 0.06em);
    padding: 0.35em 0.7em;
    border-radius: var(--style-border-radius-xs, 0);
  }
  .sh-price [hidden] { display: none !important; }

  /* ---------- intro + benefits ---------- */
  .sh-intro {
    font-size: clamp(0.95rem, 0.9rem + 0.2vw, 1.05rem);
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: rgb(var(--color-foreground-rgb, 17 17 17) / 0.78);
    max-width: 60ch;
  }
  .sh-intro p { margin: 0; }
  .sh-intro p + p { margin-top: 0.6em; }
  .sh-intro strong, .sh-intro b { color: var(--color-foreground, #111111); font-weight: 600; }

  .sh-benefits {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    width: 100%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }
  .sh-benefit {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    padding: 0.7rem 1rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--sh-hair);
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: clamp(0.88rem, 0.84rem + 0.15vw, 0.95rem);
    line-height: 1.3;
  }
  .sh-benefit .sh-ico {
    width: 1.15rem;
    height: 1.15rem;
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    display: block;
  }

  /* ---------- delivery estimate ---------- */
  .sh-eta { width: 100%; }
  .sh-eta__card {
    background: #F7F7F5;
    color: var(--color-foreground, #111111);
    border: 1px solid var(--sh-hair);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: clamp(1rem, 0.85rem + 0.6vw, 1.4rem) clamp(1rem, 0.8rem + 0.9vw, 1.6rem);
  }
  .sh-eta__track {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto 1fr auto 1fr auto;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }
  .sh-eta__icon { width: clamp(26px, 22px + 1vw, 34px); height: clamp(26px, 22px + 1vw, 34px); display: block; }
  .sh-eta__icon svg { width: 100%; height: 100%; display: block; fill: none; stroke: currentColor; stroke-width: 1.6px; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }
  .sh-eta__bar {
    position: relative;
    height: 2px;
    background: currentColor;
    border-radius: 2px;
    margin-inline: 0.35rem;
  }
  .sh-eta__bar::before,
  .sh-eta__bar::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: currentColor;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
  }
  .sh-eta__bar::before { left: -3px; }
  .sh-eta__bar::after { right: -3px; }

  .sh-eta__steps {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-top: 0.7rem;
  }
  .sh-eta__step { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.2rem; min-width: 0; }
  .sh-eta__step:nth-child(2) { text-align: center; align-items: center; }
  .sh-eta__step:nth-child(3) { text-align: right; align-items: flex-end; }
  .sh-eta__date { font-weight: 700; font-size: clamp(0.8rem, 0.76rem + 0.18vw, 0.92rem); line-height: 1.2; white-space: nowrap; }
  .sh-eta__label { font-size: clamp(0.8rem, 0.76rem + 0.18vw, 0.95rem); line-height: 1.2; color: rgb(var(--color-foreground-rgb, 17 17 17) / 0.65); }

  /* ---------- perks ---------- */
  .sh-perks { width: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.85rem; }
  .sh-perks__card {
    border: 1px solid var(--sh-hair);
    border-radius: 14px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--color-background, #FFFFFF);
  }
  .sh-perks__head { padding: 0.95rem 1.1rem 0.9rem; background: #F7F7F5; }
  .sh-perks__msg {
    margin: 0 0 0.6rem;
    font-size: clamp(0.85rem, 0.82rem + 0.12vw, 0.93rem);
    line-height: 1.35;
    color: rgb(var(--color-foreground-rgb, 17 17 17) / 0.75);
  }
  .sh-perks__msg strong { color: var(--color-foreground, #111111); font-weight: 700; }
  .sh-perks__bar {
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: rgb(var(--color-foreground-rgb, 17 17 17) / 0.1);
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .sh-perks__fill {
    display: block;
    height: 100%;
    width: var(--sh-progress, 0%);
    border-radius: inherit;
    background: var(--color-foreground, #111111);
    transition: width 0.45s ease, background 0.3s ease;
  }
  .sh-perks__card.is-complete .sh-perks__fill { background: var(--sh-ok); }

  .sh-perks__list { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  .sh-perk {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.8rem;
    padding: 0.8rem 1.1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--sh-hair);
    --sh-perk-c: var(--sh-no);
    --sh-perk-bg: rgb(192 57 43 / 0.09);
  }
  .sh-perk.is-met { --sh-perk-c: var(--sh-ok); --sh-perk-bg: rgb(46 125 79 / 0.1); }
  .sh-perk[hidden] { display: none !important; }
  .sh-perk--save .sh-perk__label strong { font-weight: 700; }
  .sh-perk__icon {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    width: 34px;
    height: 34px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    background: var(--sh-perk-bg);
    color: var(--sh-perk-c);
    transition: background 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease;
  }
  .sh-perk__icon .sh-ico { width: 18px; height: 18px; display: block; }
  .sh-perk__label {
    flex: 1 1 auto;
    min-width: 0;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: clamp(0.88rem, 0.84rem + 0.15vw, 0.97rem);
    line-height: 1.25;
    color: var(--color-foreground, #111111);
  }
  .sh-perk__status {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    padding: 0.35em 0.75em;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--sh-perk-bg);
    color: var(--sh-perk-c);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: clamp(0.72rem, 0.7rem + 0.1vw, 0.8rem);
    line-height: 1.2;
    white-space: nowrap;
    transition: background 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease;
  }

  /* ---------- trust row (jenpharm jaisi, Sheene ke rang) ---------- */
  /* columns kabhi apne sabse lambe lafz se patle nahi hote (DERMATOLOGIST),
     is liye chhoti screen par bhi text bahar nahi nikalta */
  .sh-trust {
    --sh-trust-mark: {{ TRUST_MARK_COLOR }};
    container-type: inline-size;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(var(--sh-trust-cols, 3), minmax(min-content, 1fr));
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0.35rem 0 0;
    list-style: none;
  }
  .sh-trust__item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.7rem;
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .sh-trust__icon {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    width: 2.1rem;
    height: 2.1rem;
    display: block;
    color: var(--color-foreground, #111111);
  }
  .sh-trust__icon svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    display: block;
    fill: none;
    stroke: currentColor;
    stroke-width: 1.4px;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
  }
  .sh-trust__text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.2rem;
    min-width: 0;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .sh-trust__title {
    display: block;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    line-height: 1.35;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-foreground, #111111);
  }
  .sh-trust__title span {
    padding: 0 0.15em;
    margin: 0 -0.15em;
    background: linear-gradient(transparent 52%, var(--sh-trust-mark) 52%, var(--sh-trust-mark) 94%, transparent 94%);
    -webkit-box-decoration-break: clone;
    box-decoration-break: clone;
  }
  .sh-trust__sub {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: rgb(var(--color-foreground-rgb, 17 17 17) / 0.62);
  }
  /* patli jagah (mobile, ya tablet par patla info column): icon upar, text neeche */
  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .sh-trust { gap: 0.5rem; }
    .sh-trust__item { flex-direction: column; justify-content: flex-start; gap: 0.45rem; text-align: center; }
    .sh-trust__text { align-items: center; text-align: center; }
    .sh-trust__icon { width: 1.85rem; height: 1.85rem; }
    .sh-trust__title { font-size: clamp(0.6rem, 0.45rem + 0.9vw, 0.75rem); letter-spacing: 0.04em; }
    .sh-trust__sub { font-size: clamp(0.7rem, 0.6rem + 0.5vw, 0.82rem); }
  }
  @container (max-width: 440px) {
    .sh-trust__item { flex-direction: column; justify-content: flex-start; gap: 0.45rem; text-align: center; }
    .sh-trust__text { align-items: center; text-align: center; }
    .sh-trust__icon { width: 1.85rem; height: 1.85rem; }
    .sh-trust__title { font-size: clamp(0.6rem, 0.3rem + 2.4cqi, 0.75rem); letter-spacing: 0.04em; }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 400px) {
    .sh-perk { gap: 0.65rem; padding: 0.75rem 0.9rem; }
    .sh-perks__head { padding: 0.85rem 0.9rem; }
    .sh-perk__icon { width: 30px; height: 30px; }
    .sh-tags { gap: 0.45rem; }
  }

  /* ---------- variants ---------- */
  .sh-variants { width: 100%; }
  .sh-variants-box {
    width: 100%;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0 1.25rem 1.35rem;
    border: 1px solid rgb(var(--color-border-rgb, 17 17 17) / 0.16);
    border-radius: 12px;
    min-inline-size: 0;
  }
  .sh-variants-legend {
    padding: 0 0.5rem;
    margin-inline-start: 0.25rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: clamp(0.75rem, 0.7rem + 0.15vw, 0.85rem);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: rgb(var(--color-foreground-rgb, 17 17 17) / 0.75);
  }
  .sh-option + .sh-option { margin-top: 1.25rem; }
  .sh-option-label {
    display: block;
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: clamp(0.95rem, 0.88rem + 0.25vw, 1.05rem);
    color: var(--color-foreground, #111111);
  }
  .sh-option-values { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.6rem; }
  .sh-pill {
    font-family: var(--font-body--family, system-ui, sans-serif);
    font-style: var(--font-body--style, normal);
    font-weight: var(--font-body--weight, 400);
    font-size: clamp(0.85rem, 0.8rem + 0.15vw, 0.95rem);
    line-height: 1;
    color: var(--color-foreground, #111111);
    background: transparent;
    border: 1px solid rgb(var(--color-border-rgb, 17 17 17) / 0.22);
    border-radius: {{ PILL_RADIUS }};
    padding: 0.85em 1.5em;
    min-height: var(--minimum-touch-target, 44px);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: border-color var(--animation-speed, 0.15s) ease, box-shadow var(--animation-speed, 0.15s) ease;
  }
  .sh-pill:hover { border-color: rgb(var(--color-border-rgb, 17 17 17) / 0.5); }
  .sh-pill:focus-visible {
    outline: var(--focus-outline-width, 2px) solid var(--color-foreground, #111111);
    outline-offset: var(--focus-outline-offset, 2px);
  }
  .sh-pill.is-selected {
    border-color: var(--color-foreground, #111111);
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--color-foreground, #111111);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .sh-pill.is-unavailable {
    color: rgb(var(--color-foreground-rgb, 17 17 17) / 0.4);
    border-color: rgb(var(--color-border-rgb, 17 17 17) / 0.1);
    text-decoration: line-through;
  }
  .sh-pill.is-unavailable.is-selected { box-shadow: none; font-weight: var(--font-body--weight, 400); }

  /* ---------- mobile ---------- */
  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    {% if HIDE_ARROWS_MOBILE %}.sh-gallery-arrow { display: none; }{% endif %}
    .sh-gallery { margin-bottom: {{ MOBILE_GALLERY_GAP }}; }
  }

  /* ---------- section layout ---------- */
  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .product-information__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr !important; }
    .product-information__media { display: none !important; }

    .product-details {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: {{ MAX_WIDTH }};
      margin-inline: auto;
    }

    .layout-panel-flex > *:has(> .sh-gallery),
    .layout-panel-flex > *:has(> .sh-pdp) { display: contents; }

    .layout-panel-flex:has(> * > .sh-gallery) {
      display: grid !important;
      grid-template-columns: {{ MEDIA_WIDTH }} 1fr;
      column-gap: {{ COLUMN_GAP }};
      row-gap: 0;
      align-items: start;
      align-content: start;
    }

    .layout-panel-flex:has(> * > .sh-gallery) > .sh-pdp,
    .layout-panel-flex:has(> * > .sh-gallery) .sh-pdp { margin-block-end: var(--gap-lg, 1rem); }

    .layout-panel-flex:has(> * > .sh-gallery) > .sh-gallery,
    .layout-panel-flex:has(> * > .sh-gallery) .sh-gallery {
      grid-column: 1;
      grid-row: 1 / span 50;
      {% if sticky_on %}position: sticky; top: var(--sh-sticky-top, calc(var(--header-height, 0px) + 1.5rem)); align-self: start;{% endif %}
    }

    .layout-panel-flex--row:has(.sh-gallery) { align-items: flex-start; }
    .layout-panel-flex--row > *:has(> .sh-gallery) {
      flex: 0 0 {{ MEDIA_WIDTH }};
      min-width: 0;
      {% if sticky_on %}position: sticky; top: var(--sh-sticky-top, calc(var(--header-height, 0px) + 1.5rem)); align-self: start;{% endif %}
    }
    .layout-panel-flex--row > *:has(> .sh-pdp) {
      flex: 1 1 0;
      min-width: 0;
      padding-left: {{ COLUMN_GAP }};
    }
  }
</style>
{% endif %}

{% comment %} ============ GALLERY ============ {% endcomment %}
{% if part == 'slider' or part == 'all' %}
  {% liquid
    assign media_count = product.media.size

    # LCP FIX: jo slide page khulte hi dikhti hai (selected variant ki image,
    # warna pehli image) wo eager + fetchpriority high + preload hoti hai.
    # Baaki sab slides lazy. Pehle sab lazy thin, mobile LCP 10.7s tha.
    # Variant wala check zaroori hai: ad link mein ?variant= ho to JS usi
    # variant ki image par slider le jata hai, wahi pehli nazar wali image hai.
    assign sh_lcp_media_id = product.media.first.id
    assign sh_lcp_variant = product.selected_or_first_available_variant
    if sh_lcp_variant.featured_media != blank
      assign sh_lcp_media_id = sh_lcp_variant.featured_media.id
    endif

    # Wahi slide aur uska thumbnail server se hi khule render hote hain,
    # taake JS chalne se pehle bhi sahi image dikhe (koi jump nahi).
    assign sh_start_index = 0
    assign has_image = false
    for m in product.media
      if m.id == sh_lcp_media_id
        assign sh_start_index = forloop.index0
      endif
      if m.media_type == 'image'
        assign has_image = true
      endif
    endfor
    assign sh_start_offset = sh_start_index | times: 100
    assign start_is_image = false
    if product.media[sh_start_index].media_type == 'image'
      assign start_is_image = true
    endif

    assign show_thumbs = false
    if SHOW_THUMBS and media_count > 1
      assign show_thumbs = true
    endif
    assign show_zoom = false
    if SHOW_ZOOM and has_image
      assign show_zoom = true
    endif
    assign thumb_sizes = '(min-width: 750px) ' | append: THUMB_SIZE | append: ', ' | append: THUMB_SIZE_MOBILE
  %}

  <div class="sh-gallery" id="ShGallery-{{ product.id }}" data-total="{{ media_count }}" data-start="{{ sh_start_index }}">
    <div class="sh-gallery-stage{% if show_thumbs %} sh-gallery-stage--thumbs{% endif %}">
      <div class="sh-gallery-viewport">
        {% if media_count > 0 %}
          <div class="sh-gallery-track"{% if sh_start_offset > 0 %} style="transform: translateX(-{{ sh_start_offset }}%);"{% endif %}>
            {% for media in product.media %}
              <div class="sh-gallery-slide" data-index="{{ forloop.index0 }}">
                {% case media.media_type %}
                  {% when 'image' %}
                    {%- liquid
                      if media.id == sh_lcp_media_id
                        assign sh_img_loading = 'eager'
                        assign sh_img_priority = 'high'
                        assign sh_img_preload = true
                      else
                        assign sh_img_loading = 'lazy'
                        assign sh_img_priority = 'auto'
                        assign sh_img_preload = false
                      endif
                      # alt pehle assign karna zaroori hai: filter argument ke andar
                      # "| default" lagane se class wagera image_tag tak pohanchte hi nahi thay
                      assign sh_img_alt = media.alt | default: product.title
                    -%}
                    {{
                      media
                      | image_url: width: 1600
                      | image_tag:
                        loading: sh_img_loading,
                        fetchpriority: sh_img_priority,
                        preload: sh_img_preload,
                        sizes: '(min-width: 750px) 52vw, 100vw',
                        widths: '400,600,800,1000,1200,1600',
                        alt: sh_img_alt,
                        class: 'sh-gallery-media'
                    }}
                  {% when 'video' %}
                    {{ media | video_tag: controls: true, autoplay: false, loop: false, muted: false, class: 'sh-gallery-media' }}
                  {% when 'external_video' %}
                    <div class="sh-gallery-media sh-gallery-media--embed">{{ media | external_video_tag }}</div>
                  {% when 'model' %}
                    {{ media | model_viewer_tag: class: 'sh-gallery-media' }}
                {% endcase %}
              </div>
            {% endfor %}
          </div>
        {% else %}
          <div class="sh-gallery-slide sh-gallery-empty"></div>
        {% endif %}

        {% if media_count > 1 %}
          <button type="button" class="sh-gallery-arrow sh-gallery-arrow--prev" data-direction="prev" aria-label="Previous image">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14.5 5.5 8 12l6.5 6.5"/></svg>
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="sh-gallery-arrow sh-gallery-arrow--next" data-direction="next" aria-label="Next image">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9.5 5.5 6.5 6.5-6.5 6.5"/></svg>
          </button>
        {% endif %}

        {% if show_zoom %}
          <button type="button" class="sh-gallery-zoom" aria-label="Zoom image" aria-haspopup="dialog"{% unless start_is_image %} hidden{% endunless %}>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="10.75" cy="10.75" r="6.25"/><path d="m15.5 15.5 4.25 4.25M10.75 8v5.5M8 10.75h5.5"/></svg>
          </button>
        {% endif %}
      </div>

      {% if show_thumbs %}
        <div class="sh-gallery-thumbs-wrap">
          <div class="sh-gallery-thumbs" role="group" aria-label="Product images">
            {% for media in product.media %}
              {%- liquid
                assign thumb_on = false
                if forloop.index0 == sh_start_index
                  assign thumb_on = true
                endif
              -%}
              <button type="button" class="sh-gallery-thumb{% if thumb_on %} is-active{% endif %}" data-goto="{{ forloop.index0 }}" aria-label="Show image {{ forloop.index }} of {{ media_count }}"{% if thumb_on %} aria-current="true"{% endif %}>
                {%- if media.preview_image != blank -%}
                  {{ media.preview_image | image_url: width: 240 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', widths: '120,180,240', sizes: thumb_sizes, alt: '' }}
                {%- endif -%}
                {%- if media.media_type == 'video' or media.media_type == 'external_video' -%}
                  <span class="sh-gallery-thumb__play" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M8 5.5v13l10.5-6.5z"/></svg></span>
                {%- endif -%}
              </button>
            {% endfor %}
          </div>
        </div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>

    {% if media_count > 1 and show_thumbs == false %}
      <div class="sh-gallery-dots" aria-label="Product images">
        {% for media in product.media %}
          <button type="button" class="sh-gallery-dot{% if forloop.index0 == sh_start_index %} is-active{% endif %}" data-goto="{{ forloop.index0 }}" aria-label="Go to image {{ forloop.index }}"></button>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    {% endif %}

    {% if EXPERT_UNDER_SLIDER and expert_html != blank %}
      <div class="sh-gallery-expert">{{ expert_html }}</div>
    {% endif %}

    {% if show_zoom %}
      <dialog class="sh-zoom" aria-label="Product image zoom">
        <div class="sh-zoom__stage" tabindex="-1" autofocus><img class="sh-zoom__img" alt="" decoding="async"></div>
        <button type="button" class="sh-zoom__btn sh-zoom__close" data-zoom-close aria-label="Close zoom">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 6l12 12M18 6 6 18"/></svg>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="sh-zoom__btn sh-zoom__nav sh-zoom__nav--prev" data-zoom-prev aria-label="Previous image">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14.5 5.5 8 12l6.5 6.5"/></svg>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="sh-zoom__btn sh-zoom__nav sh-zoom__nav--next" data-zoom-next aria-label="Next image">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9.5 5.5 6.5 6.5-6.5 6.5"/></svg>
        </button>
        <p class="sh-zoom__count" aria-live="polite"><span data-zoom-current>1</span> / <span data-zoom-total>1</span></p>
      </dialog>
    {% endif %}
  </div>

  <script>
    (function () {
      var root = document.getElementById('ShGallery-{{ product.id }}');
      if (!root || root.dataset.shInit) return;
      root.dataset.shInit = '1';

      var total = parseInt(root.dataset.total, 10) || 0;
      var track = root.querySelector('.sh-gallery-track');
      var slides = root.querySelectorAll('.sh-gallery-slide[data-index]');
      var dots = root.querySelectorAll('.sh-gallery-dot');
      var thumbs = root.querySelectorAll('.sh-gallery-thumb');
      var thumbList = root.querySelector('.sh-gallery-thumbs');
      var arrows = root.querySelectorAll('.sh-gallery-arrow');
      var zoomBtn = root.querySelector('.sh-gallery-zoom');
      var vp = root.querySelector('.sh-gallery-viewport');
      var index = parseInt(root.dataset.start, 10) || 0;
      var ready = false;

      function slideImg(i) {
        var s = slides[i];
        return s ? s.querySelector('img.sh-gallery-media') : null;
      }

      /* active thumbnail ko list ke andar nazar mein lao, page scroll kiye bina */
      function revealThumb(t) {
        if (!t || !thumbList) return;
        var l = thumbList.getBoundingClientRect();
        var r = t.getBoundingClientRect();
        if (r.top < l.top) thumbList.scrollTop -= l.top - r.top + 8;
        else if (r.bottom > l.bottom) thumbList.scrollTop += r.bottom - l.bottom + 8;
        if (r.left < l.left) thumbList.scrollLeft -= l.left - r.left + 8;
        else if (r.right > l.right) thumbList.scrollLeft += r.right - l.right + 8;
      }

      function goTo(n) {
        if (total < 1 || !track) return;
        var next = ((n % total) + total) % total;
        if (ready && next === index) return;
        index = next;
        track.style.transform = 'translateX(-' + (index * 100) + '%)';
        dots.forEach(function (d, i) { d.classList.toggle('is-active', i === index); });
        thumbs.forEach(function (t, i) {
          var on = i === index;
          t.classList.toggle('is-active', on);
          if (on) t.setAttribute('aria-current', 'true');
          else t.removeAttribute('aria-current');
        });
        if (ready) revealThumb(thumbs[index]);
        if (zoomBtn) zoomBtn.hidden = !slideImg(index);
        root.querySelectorAll('video').forEach(function (v) { v.pause(); });
      }
      root.shGoTo = goTo;

      arrows.forEach(function (b) {
        b.addEventListener('click', function () {
          goTo(b.dataset.direction === 'next' ? index + 1 : index - 1);
        });
      });
      dots.forEach(function (d) {
        d.addEventListener('click', function () { goTo(parseInt(d.dataset.goto, 10)); });
      });
      thumbs.forEach(function (t) {
        t.addEventListener('click', function () { goTo(parseInt(t.dataset.goto, 10)); });
      });

      /* swipe. Chhota sa tap swipe nahi hai, wo zoom kholta hai. */
      var startX = 0;
      var startY = 0;
      var swiped = false;
      if (vp) {
        vp.addEventListener('touchstart', function (e) {
          startX = e.touches[0].clientX;
          startY = e.touches[0].clientY;
          swiped = false;
        }, { passive: true });
        vp.addEventListener('touchend', function (e) {
          var dx = startX - e.changedTouches[0].clientX;
          var dy = startY - e.changedTouches[0].clientY;
          if (Math.abs(dx) > 10 || Math.abs(dy) > 10) swiped = true;
          if (total > 1 && Math.abs(dx) > 40 && Math.abs(dx) > Math.abs(dy)) goTo(dx > 0 ? index + 1 : index - 1);
        }, { passive: true });
      }

      goTo(index);
      ready = true;
      /* ?variant= link ki image aage ho to uska thumbnail bhi load par nazar aaye */
      if (thumbList && index > 0) {
        thumbList.style.scrollBehavior = 'auto';
        revealThumb(thumbs[index]);
        thumbList.style.scrollBehavior = '';
      }

      {% if sticky_on and SAFE_MODE == false %}
      /* Sticky left column jo viewport se lamba ho: pehle scroll hota hai,
         bottom tak pohanch kar chipak jata hai, jaise jenpharm par. */
      var GAP = 24;
      function headerOffset() {
        var v = parseFloat(getComputedStyle(root).getPropertyValue('--header-height'));
        if (!isNaN(v) && v > 0) return v;
        var h = document.querySelector('header-component, .header-wrapper, header');
        return h ? h.getBoundingClientRect().height : 0;
      }
      function setStickyTop() {
        var base = headerOffset() + GAP;
        var h = root.offsetHeight;
        var vh = window.innerHeight;
        var top = (base + h + GAP > vh) ? (vh - h - GAP) : base;
        var val = top + 'px';
        root.style.setProperty('--sh-sticky-top', val);
        if (root.parentElement) root.parentElement.style.setProperty('--sh-sticky-top', val);
      }
      setStickyTop();
      window.addEventListener('resize', setStickyTop);
      window.addEventListener('load', setStickyTop);
      if (window.ResizeObserver) new ResizeObserver(setStickyTop).observe(root);
      {% endif %}

      {% if show_zoom %}
      /* ---- full screen zoom: ek hi <img>, hi-res file sirf khulne par aati hai ---- */
      var dlg = root.querySelector('dialog.sh-zoom');
      if (dlg) {
        var zStage = dlg.querySelector('.sh-zoom__stage');
        var zImg = dlg.querySelector('.sh-zoom__img');
        var zCur = dlg.querySelector('[data-zoom-current]');
        var zTot = dlg.querySelector('[data-zoom-total]');
        var imgIdx = [];
        slides.forEach(function (s, i) { if (s.querySelector('img.sh-gallery-media')) imgIdx.push(i); });
        var zPos = 0;
        var zoomed = false;
        var zMoved = false;
        var zx = 0;
        var zy = 0;

        var bigSrc = function (img) {
          var raw = img.getAttribute('src') || img.currentSrc || '';
          try {
            var u = new URL(raw, window.location.href);
            var px = Math.max(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight) * Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio || 1, 2.5);
            u.searchParams.set('width', String(Math.min(2400, Math.max(1000, Math.ceil(px / 200) * 200))));
            return u.toString();
          } catch (e) {
            return raw;
          }
        };
        var setOrigin = function (cx, cy) {
          var r = zStage.getBoundingClientRect();
          if (!r.width || !r.height) return;
          var x = Math.min(100, Math.max(0, ((cx - r.left) / r.width) * 100));
          var y = Math.min(100, Math.max(0, ((cy - r.top) / r.height) * 100));
          zImg.style.transformOrigin = x + '% ' + y + '%';
        };
        var setZoom = function (on, cx, cy) {
          zoomed = !!on;
          if (zoomed && cx !== undefined) setOrigin(cx, cy);
          dlg.classList.toggle('is-zoomed', zoomed);
        };
        var show = function (p) {
          if (!imgIdx.length) return;
          zPos = ((p % imgIdx.length) + imgIdx.length) % imgIdx.length;
          var img = slideImg(imgIdx[zPos]);
          if (!img) return;
          setZoom(false);
          var hi = bigSrc(img);
          zImg.dataset.want = hi;
          zImg.src = img.currentSrc || img.getAttribute('src');
          zImg.alt = img.getAttribute('alt') || '';
          var pre = new Image();
          pre.onload = function () { if (zImg.dataset.want === hi) zImg.src = hi; };
          pre.src = hi;
          if (zCur) zCur.textContent = zPos + 1;
          goTo(imgIdx[zPos]);
        };
        var open = function () {
          var p = imgIdx.indexOf(index);
          if (p < 0) return;
          if (zTot) zTot.textContent = imgIdx.length;
          dlg.classList.toggle('sh-zoom--single', imgIdx.length < 2);
          show(p);
          if (dlg.open) return;
          if (typeof dlg.showModal === 'function') dlg.showModal();
          else dlg.setAttribute('open', '');
        };

        if (zoomBtn) zoomBtn.addEventListener('click', open);
        imgIdx.forEach(function (i) {
          slideImg(i).addEventListener('click', function () { if (!swiped) open(); });
        });
        dlg.querySelector('[data-zoom-close]').addEventListener('click', function () { dlg.close(); });
        dlg.querySelector('[data-zoom-prev]').addEventListener('click', function () { show(zPos - 1); });
        dlg.querySelector('[data-zoom-next]').addEventListener('click', function () { show(zPos + 1); });
        dlg.addEventListener('keydown', function (e) {
          if (e.key === 'ArrowLeft') { e.preventDefault(); show(zPos - 1); }
          else if (e.key === 'ArrowRight') { e.preventDefault(); show(zPos + 1); }
        });
        dlg.addEventListener('close', function () { setZoom(false); });

        /* click = 2x zoom on/off, zoom mein mouse ya ungli se pan */
        zImg.addEventListener('click', function (e) {
          if (zMoved) { zMoved = false; return; }
          setZoom(!zoomed, e.clientX, e.clientY);
        });
        zStage.addEventListener('mousemove', function (e) {
          if (zoomed) setOrigin(e.clientX, e.clientY);
        });
        zStage.addEventListener('touchstart', function (e) {
          if (e.touches.length !== 1) return;
          zx = e.touches[0].clientX;
          zy = e.touches[0].clientY;
          zMoved = false;
        }, { passive: true });
        zStage.addEventListener('touchmove', function (e) {
          if (e.touches.length !== 1) return;
          var t = e.touches[0];
          if (Math.abs(t.clientX - zx) > 8 || Math.abs(t.clientY - zy) > 8) zMoved = true;
          if (zoomed) setOrigin(t.clientX, t.clientY);
        }, { passive: true });
        /* iPhone par html overflow lock kaafi nahi: ek ungli ka drag page ko scroll na kare */
        dlg.addEventListener('touchmove', function (e) {
          if (!zoomed && e.touches.length === 1 && e.cancelable) e.preventDefault();
        }, { passive: false });
        zStage.addEventListener('touchend', function (e) {
          if (zoomed || !zMoved || e.changedTouches.length !== 1) return;
          var dx = zx - e.changedTouches[0].clientX;
          var dy = zy - e.changedTouches[0].clientY;
          if (Math.abs(dx) > 50 && Math.abs(dx) > Math.abs(dy)) show(dx > 0 ? zPos + 1 : zPos - 1);
        }, { passive: true });
      }
      {% endif %}
    })();
  </script>
{% endif %}


{% comment %} ============ INFO ============ {% endcomment %}
{% if part == 'body' or part == 'all' %}
  {% liquid
    assign current_variant = product.selected_or_first_available_variant

    assign rating_value = 0
    assign rating_count = 0
    if product.metafields.reviews.rating.value != blank
      assign rating_value = product.metafields.reviews.rating.value.rating | times: 1.0
      assign rating_count = product.metafields.reviews.rating_count.value | times: 1
    elsif product.metafields.loox.avg_rating != blank
      assign rating_value = product.metafields.loox.avg_rating.value | times: 1.0
      assign rating_count = product.metafields.loox.num_reviews.value | times: 1
    endif
    assign rating_percent = rating_value | times: 20.0
    assign rating_display = rating_value | round: 1

    assign badge_field = product.metafields.custom.pp_badges
    assign badge_list = ''
    if badge_field != blank
      if badge_field.type contains 'list.'
        assign badge_list = badge_field.value
      else
        assign badge_list = badge_field.value | newline_to_br | split: '<br />'
      endif
    endif
    assign allowed_colors = 'neutral,blue,yellow,purple,green,pink,orange,dark' | split: ','

    assign sold = product.metafields.custom.sold_count.value | default: 0 | times: 1
    assign sold_label = ''
    if sold >= SOLD_MIN
      if sold >= 1000000
        assign sold_tenths = sold | divided_by: 100000
        assign sold_num = sold_tenths | divided_by: 10.0 | append: '' | remove: '.0'
        assign sold_label = sold_num | append: 'M+ ' | append: SOLD_SUFFIX
      elsif sold >= 10000
        assign sold_num = sold | divided_by: 1000
        assign sold_label = sold_num | append: 'K+ ' | append: SOLD_SUFFIX
      elsif sold >= 1000
        assign sold_tenths = sold | divided_by: 100
        assign sold_num = sold_tenths | divided_by: 10.0 | append: '' | remove: '.0'
        assign sold_label = sold_num | append: 'K+ ' | append: SOLD_SUFFIX
      else
        assign sold_label = sold | append: ' ' | append: SOLD_SUFFIX
      endif
    endif

    assign show_stars = false
    if rating_count > 0 or SHOW_EMPTY_STATE
      assign show_stars = true
    endif

    assign subtitle = product.metafields.custom.pp_subtitle.value
    assign intro_field = product.metafields.custom.pp_intro
    assign benefits = product.metafields.custom.pp_benefits.value

    # perks ka hisaab: is product ki price (selected variant), cart nahi
    assign cart_cents = current_variant.price | default: 0
    assign fd_cents = FREE_DELIVERY_MIN | times: 100
    assign ts_cents = TESTERS_MIN | times: 100

    assign has_real_options = false
    for option in product.options_with_values
      unless option.name == 'Title' and option.values.size == 1
        assign has_real_options = true
      endunless
    endfor
  %}

  <div class="sh-pdp" id="ShPdp-{{ product.id }}" data-gallery="ShGallery-{{ product.id }}">

    {% if badge_list != blank and badge_list.size > 0 %}
      {% capture tags_html %}
        {% for raw in badge_list %}
          {% liquid
            assign bits = raw | split: '|'
            assign tag_text = bits[0] | strip
            assign tag_color = bits[1] | strip | downcase | default: 'neutral'
            assign tag_icon = bits[2] | strip | downcase
            assign tag_style = ''

            assign first_char = tag_color | slice: 0
            if first_char == '#'
              assign hex_pair = tag_color | split: '/'
              assign hex_bg = hex_pair[0] | strip
              assign hex_fg = hex_pair[1] | strip
              assign bg_len = hex_bg | size
              if bg_len == 4 or bg_len == 7
                if hex_fg == blank
                  assign bg_brightness = hex_bg | color_brightness
                  if bg_brightness > 150
                    assign hex_fg = hex_bg | color_darken: 58
                  else
                    assign hex_fg = '#FFFFFF'
                  endif
                endif
                assign tag_style = '--sh-tag-bg:' | append: hex_bg | append: ';--sh-tag-fg:' | append: hex_fg | append: ';'
              endif
              assign tag_color = 'neutral'
            else
              unless allowed_colors contains tag_color
                assign tag_color = 'neutral'
              endunless
            endif
          %}
          {% if tag_text != blank %}
            <li class="sh-tag sh-tag--{{ tag_color }}"{% if tag_style != blank %} style="{{ tag_style | escape }}"{% endif %}>
              <span>{{ tag_text | escape }}</span>
              {% case tag_icon %}
                {% when 'truck' %}
                  <span class="sh-tag__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M2.75 6.25h10.5v9.5H2.75z"/><path d="M13.25 9.75h3.4l3.6 3.4v2.6h-7z"/><circle cx="6.75" cy="17.75" r="1.6"/><circle cx="16.75" cy="17.75" r="1.6"/><path d="M8.35 17.75h6.8"/></svg></span>
                {% when 'check' %}
                  <span class="sh-tag__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="m5 12.5 4.5 4.5L19 7.5"/></svg></span>
                {% when 'sparkle' %}
                  <span class="sh-tag__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3c.6 4.6 3.4 7.4 8 8-4.6.6-7.4 3.4-8 8-.6-4.6-3.4-7.4-8-8 4.6-.6 7.4-3.4 8-8z"/></svg></span>
                {% when 'drop' %}
                  <span class="sh-tag__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3.5s6 6.4 6 10.5a6 6 0 0 1-12 0c0-4.1 6-10.5 6-10.5z"/></svg></span>
                {% when 'leaf' %}
                  <span class="sh-tag__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 19c0-8 5-13 14-14 0 9-5 14-13 14"/><path d="M5 19 13 11"/></svg></span>
              {% endcase %}
            </li>
          {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
      {% endcapture %}
      {% if tags_html contains '<li' %}
        <ul class="sh-tags" aria-label="Product highlights">{{ tags_html }}</ul>
      {% endif %}
    {% endif %}

    <h1 class="sh-title">{{ product.title }}</h1>

    {% if show_stars or sold_label != blank %}
      <div class="sh-meta">
        {% if rating_count > 0 %}
          <a class="sh-rating" href="{{ REVIEWS_ANCHOR }}"
             aria-label="Rated {{ rating_display }} out of 5 from {{ rating_count }} reviews">
            <span class="sh-rating-stars" style="--sh-rating: {{ rating_percent }}%;" aria-hidden="true">
              <span class="sh-rating-stars-bg">★★★★★</span>
              <span class="sh-rating-stars-fg">★★★★★</span>
            </span>
            <span class="sh-rating-value">{{ rating_display }}</span>
            {% if SHOW_REVIEW_COUNT %}<span class="sh-rating-count">({{ rating_count }})</span>{% endif %}
          </a>
        {% elsif SHOW_EMPTY_STATE %}
          <a class="sh-rating sh-rating--empty" href="{{ REVIEWS_ANCHOR }}">
            <span class="sh-rating-stars" style="--sh-rating: 0%;" aria-hidden="true">
              <span class="sh-rating-stars-bg">★★★★★</span>
              <span class="sh-rating-stars-fg">★★★★★</span>
            </span>
            <span class="sh-rating-count">Be the first to review</span>
          </a>
        {% endif %}

        {% if sold_label != blank %}
          <span class="sh-sold">
            {% if show_stars %}<span class="sh-sold__sep" aria-hidden="true"></span>{% endif %}
            <span class="sh-sold__label">{{ sold_label }}</span>
          </span>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    {% endif %}

    {% if subtitle != blank %}
      <p class="sh-subtitle">{{ subtitle | escape }}</p>
    {% endif %}

    {%- liquid
      assign off_pct = 0
      if current_variant.compare_at_price > current_variant.price
        assign off_pct = current_variant.compare_at_price | minus: current_variant.price | times: 100 | divided_by: current_variant.compare_at_price
      endif
    -%}
    <div class="sh-price">
      <span class="sh-price-compare" data-sh-compare
        {% unless current_variant.compare_at_price > current_variant.price %}hidden{% endunless %}>
        {{ current_variant.compare_at_price | money }}
      </span>
      <span class="sh-price-current" data-sh-current>{{ current_variant.price | money }}</span>
      <span class="sh-price-badge" data-sh-badge
        {% unless current_variant.compare_at_price > current_variant.price %}hidden{% endunless %}>{% if off_pct >= 1 %}{{ off_pct }}% OFF{% else %}Sale{% endif %}</span>
    </div>

    {% if intro_field != blank %}
      <div class="sh-intro">
        {% if intro_field.type == 'rich_text_field' %}
          {{ intro_field | metafield_tag }}
        {% else %}
          <p>{{ intro_field.value | escape | newline_to_br }}</p>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    {% endif %}

    {% if benefits != blank and benefits.size > 0 %}
      <ul class="sh-benefits">
        {% for b in benefits %}
          {% assign b_text = b | strip %}
          {% if b_text != blank %}
            <li class="sh-benefit">
              <span class="sh-ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="m8.2 12.3 2.6 2.6 5-5.2"/></svg></span>
              <span>{{ b_text | escape }}</span>
            </li>
          {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    {% endif %}

    {% if SHOW_DELIVERY %}
      <div class="sh-eta" data-sh-eta
           data-min="{{ DELIVERY_MIN_DAYS }}"
           data-max="{{ DELIVERY_MAX_DAYS }}"
           data-process="{{ ETA_PROCESS_DAYS }}"
           data-cutoff="{{ ETA_CUTOFF_HOUR }}">
        <div class="sh-eta__card">
          <div class="sh-eta__track" aria-hidden="true">
            <span class="sh-eta__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5.5 8h13l-1 12.5h-11z"/><path d="M9 10V6.5a3 3 0 0 1 6 0V10"/></svg></span>
            <span class="sh-eta__bar"></span>
            <span class="sh-eta__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M2.75 6.25h10.5v9.5H2.75z"/><path d="M13.25 9.75h3.4l3.6 3.4v2.6h-7z"/><circle cx="6.75" cy="17.75" r="1.6"/><circle cx="16.75" cy="17.75" r="1.6"/></svg></span>
            <span class="sh-eta__bar"></span>
            <span class="sh-eta__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 21s-6.5-6.2-6.5-11.2a6.5 6.5 0 0 1 13 0C18.5 14.8 12 21 12 21z"/><circle cx="12" cy="9.8" r="2.4"/></svg></span>
          </div>
          <div class="sh-eta__steps">
            <div class="sh-eta__step"><span class="sh-eta__date" data-eta-s1>&nbsp;</span><span class="sh-eta__label">{{ ETA_STEP_1 }}</span></div>
            <div class="sh-eta__step"><span class="sh-eta__date" data-eta-s2>&nbsp;</span><span class="sh-eta__label">{{ ETA_STEP_2 }}</span></div>
            <div class="sh-eta__step"><span class="sh-eta__date" data-eta-s3>&nbsp;</span><span class="sh-eta__label">{{ ETA_STEP_3 }}</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    {% endif %}

    {% liquid
      assign next_min = 0
      assign next_label = ''
      if fd_cents > cart_cents
        assign next_min = fd_cents
        assign next_label = FREE_DELIVERY_LABEL
      endif
      if ts_cents > cart_cents
        if next_min == 0 or ts_cents < next_min
          assign next_min = ts_cents
          assign next_label = TESTERS_LABEL
        endif
      endif
      assign progress = 100
      if next_min > 0
        assign progress = cart_cents | times: 100 | divided_by: next_min
      endif
    %}
    <div class="sh-perks" data-sh-perks>
      <div class="sh-perks__card{% if next_min == 0 %} is-complete{% endif %}" data-sh-perks-card>
        <div class="sh-perks__head">
          <p class="sh-perks__msg" data-sh-perks-msg>
            {%- if next_min == 0 -%}
              <strong>{{ PERKS_ALL_TEXT }}</strong>
            {%- else -%}
              {%- assign away = next_min | minus: cart_cents -%}
              <strong>{{ away | money_without_trailing_zeros }}</strong> {{ PERKS_AWAY_TEXT }} <strong>{{ next_label }}</strong>
            {%- endif -%}
          </p>
          <div class="sh-perks__bar" aria-hidden="true"><span class="sh-perks__fill" data-sh-perks-fill style="--sh-progress: {{ progress }}%;"></span></div>
        </div>
        <ul class="sh-perks__list">
          <li class="sh-perk {% if cart_cents >= fd_cents %}is-met{% endif %}" data-sh-perk data-min="{{ fd_cents }}" data-label="{{ FREE_DELIVERY_LABEL | escape }}">
            <span class="sh-perk__icon" aria-hidden="true"><span class="sh-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M2.75 6.25h10.5v9.5H2.75z"/><path d="M13.25 9.75h3.4l3.6 3.4v2.6h-7z"/><circle cx="6.75" cy="17.75" r="1.6"/><circle cx="16.75" cy="17.75" r="1.6"/><path d="M8.35 17.75h6.8"/></svg></span></span>
            <span class="sh-perk__label">{{ FREE_DELIVERY_LABEL }}</span>
            <span class="sh-perk__status" data-sh-perk-status>{% if fd_cents == 0 %}{{ PERK_ALWAYS_TEXT }}{% elsif cart_cents >= fd_cents %}{{ PERK_MET_TEXT }}{% else %}Add {% assign gap = fd_cents | minus: cart_cents %}{{ gap | money_without_trailing_zeros }} more{% endif %}</span>
          </li>
          <li class="sh-perk {% if cart_cents >= ts_cents %}is-met{% endif %}" data-sh-perk data-min="{{ ts_cents }}" data-label="{{ TESTERS_LABEL | escape }}">
            <span class="sh-perk__icon" aria-hidden="true"><span class="sh-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9.5 3h5M10.5 3v3.5h3V3"/><path d="M9 6.5h6a1 1 0 0 1 1 1V20a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H9a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V7.5a1 1 0 0 1 1-1z"/><path d="M8 12h8"/></svg></span></span>
            <span class="sh-perk__label">{{ TESTERS_LABEL }}</span>
            <span class="sh-perk__status" data-sh-perk-status>{% if ts_cents == 0 %}{{ PERK_ALWAYS_TEXT }}{% elsif cart_cents >= ts_cents %}{{ PERK_MET_TEXT }}{% else %}Add {% assign gap = ts_cents | minus: cart_cents %}{{ gap | money_without_trailing_zeros }} more{% endif %}</span>
          </li>
          {%- liquid
            assign was = current_variant.compare_at_price | default: 0
            assign save_cents = 0
            if was > current_variant.price
              assign save_cents = was | minus: current_variant.price
            endif
          -%}
          <li class="sh-perk sh-perk--save is-met" data-sh-save{% if save_cents == 0 %} hidden{% endif %}>
            <span class="sh-perk__icon" aria-hidden="true"><span class="sh-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3.5 12.2V4.5a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h7.7a1 1 0 0 1 .7.3l7.6 7.6a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.4l-7.7 7.7a1 1 0 0 1-1.4 0l-7.6-7.6a1 1 0 0 1-.3-.7z"/><circle cx="8.2" cy="8.2" r="1.4"/></svg></span></span>
            <span class="sh-perk__label">{{ SAVE_TEXT_BEFORE }} <strong data-sh-save-amount>{{ save_cents | money_without_trailing_zeros }}</strong> {{ SAVE_TEXT_AFTER }}</span>
            <span class="sh-perk__status">{{ SAVE_PILL }}</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      {%- liquid
        assign trust_cols = 2
        if SHOW_DERMATOLOGIST
          assign trust_cols = 3
        endif
      -%}
      <ul class="sh-trust" style="--sh-trust-cols: {{ trust_cols }};">
        <li class="sh-trust__item">
          <span class="sh-trust__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="2.75" y="6.25" width="18.5" height="11.5" rx="1.75"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2.75"/><path d="M6.25 9.5v5M17.75 9.5v5"/></svg></span>
          <span class="sh-trust__text">
            <span class="sh-trust__title"><span>{{ TRUST_COD_TITLE | escape }}</span></span>
            <span class="sh-trust__sub">{{ TRUST_COD_SUB | escape }}</span>
          </span>
        </li>
        {%- if SHOW_DERMATOLOGIST %}
        <li class="sh-trust__item">
          <span class="sh-trust__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9.25 3.25h5.5"/><path d="M10.25 3.25v5.4l-4.9 8.6a2 2 0 0 0 1.74 2.99h9.82a2 2 0 0 0 1.74-2.99l-4.9-8.6v-5.4"/><path d="M7.6 14.25h8.8"/></svg></span>
          <span class="sh-trust__text">
            <span class="sh-trust__title"><span>{{ TRUST_DERM_TITLE | escape }}</span></span>
            <span class="sh-trust__sub">{{ TRUST_DERM_SUB | escape }}</span>
          </span>
        </li>
        {%- endif %}
        <li class="sh-trust__item">
          <span class="sh-trust__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3.25" y="5.25" width="17.5" height="4" rx="1"/><path d="M4.75 9.25v9.5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h12.5a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-9.5"/><path d="M10.25 12.75h3.5a1.75 1.75 0 0 1 0 3.5h-2.5"/><path d="m11.75 11.25-1.5 1.5 1.5 1.5"/></svg></span>
          <span class="sh-trust__text">
            <span class="sh-trust__title"><span>{{ TRUST_RETURNS_TITLE | escape }}</span></span>
            <span class="sh-trust__sub">{{ TRUST_RETURNS_SUB | escape }}</span>
          </span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    {% if has_real_options %}
      <div class="sh-variants">
        <fieldset class="sh-variants-box">
          <legend class="sh-variants-legend">{{ VARIANT_BOX_TITLE }}</legend>

          {% for option in product.options_with_values %}
            {% unless option.name == 'Title' and option.values.size == 1 %}
              <div class="sh-option" data-option-position="{{ option.position }}">
                <span class="sh-option-label">{{ OPTION_LABEL_PREFIX }} {{ option.name }}</span>
                <div class="sh-option-values">
                  {% for value in option.values %}
                    <button
                      type="button"
                      class="sh-pill{% if option.selected_value == value %} is-selected{% endif %}"
                      data-option-position="{{ option.position }}"
                      data-option-value="{{ value | escape }}"
                      aria-pressed="{% if option.selected_value == value %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}"
                    >{{ value }}</button>
                  {% endfor %}
                </div>
              </div>
            {% endunless %}
          {% endfor %}
        </fieldset>
      </div>
    {% endif %}

    <script type="application/json" data-sh-variant-data>
      [{% for v in product.variants %}{
        "id": {{ v.id }},
        "available": {{ v.available }},
        "options": {{ v.options | json }},
        "price": {{ v.price | money | json }},
        "price_cents": {{ v.price | default: 0 }},
        "compare_cents": {{ v.compare_at_price | default: 0 }},
        "compare_at": {{ v.compare_at_price | money | json }},
        "on_sale": {% if v.compare_at_price > v.price %}true{% else %}false{% endif %},
        "media_index": {% if v.featured_media %}{{ v.featured_media.position | minus: 1 }}{% else %}null{% endif %}
      }{% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}{% endfor %}]
    </script>
  </div>

  {% comment %} ---------- variants ---------- {% endcomment %}
  <script>
    (function () {
      var root = document.getElementById('ShPdp-{{ product.id }}');
      if (!root || root.dataset.shInit) return;
      root.dataset.shInit = '1';

      var dataEl = root.querySelector('[data-sh-variant-data]');
      if (!dataEl) return;
      var variants = [];
      try { variants = JSON.parse(dataEl.textContent); } catch (e) { return; }
      if (!variants.length) return;

      var priceCurrent = root.querySelector('[data-sh-current]');
      var priceCompare = root.querySelector('[data-sh-compare]');
      var priceBadge = root.querySelector('[data-sh-badge]');
      var gallery = document.getElementById(root.dataset.gallery);

      function selectedOptions() {
        var out = [];
        root.querySelectorAll('.sh-option').forEach(function (fs) {
          var pos = parseInt(fs.dataset.optionPosition, 10);
          var active = fs.querySelector('.sh-pill.is-selected');
          out[pos - 1] = active ? active.dataset.optionValue : null;
        });
        return out;
      }

      function match(opts) {
        return variants.find(function (v) {
          return opts.every(function (val, i) { return val === null || v.options[i] === val; });
        });
      }

      function markAvailability(opts) {
        root.querySelectorAll('.sh-option').forEach(function (fs) {
          var pos = parseInt(fs.dataset.optionPosition, 10);
          fs.querySelectorAll('.sh-pill').forEach(function (pill) {
            var test = opts.slice();
            test[pos - 1] = pill.dataset.optionValue;
            var m = match(test);
            pill.classList.toggle('is-unavailable', !m || !m.available);
          });
        });
      }

      function apply() {
        var opts = selectedOptions();
        var variant = match(opts);
        markAvailability(opts);
        if (!variant) return;

        if (priceCurrent) priceCurrent.innerHTML = variant.price;
        if (priceCompare) {
          priceCompare.innerHTML = variant.compare_at || '';
          priceCompare.hidden = !variant.on_sale;
        }
        if (priceBadge) {
          priceBadge.hidden = !variant.on_sale;
          if (variant.on_sale) {
            var pct = Math.floor((variant.compare_cents - variant.price_cents) * 100 / variant.compare_cents);
            priceBadge.textContent = pct >= 1 ? pct + '% OFF' : 'Sale';
          }
        }

        root.dataset.price = variant.price_cents;
        root.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('sheene:variant', { detail: { price: variant.price_cents, compare: variant.compare_cents } }));

        document.querySelectorAll('form[action*="/cart/add"] [name="id"]').forEach(function (el) {
          el.value = variant.id;
          el.dispatchEvent(new Event('change', { bubbles: true }));
        });

        if (window.history && history.replaceState) {
          var url = new URL(window.location.href);
          url.searchParams.set('variant', variant.id);
          history.replaceState({}, '', url.toString());
        }

        if (gallery && typeof gallery.shGoTo === 'function' && variant.media_index !== null) {
          gallery.shGoTo(variant.media_index);
        }
      }

      root.querySelectorAll('.sh-pill').forEach(function (pill) {
        pill.addEventListener('click', function () {
          var fs = pill.closest('.sh-option');
          fs.querySelectorAll('.sh-pill').forEach(function (p) {
            p.classList.remove('is-selected');
            p.setAttribute('aria-pressed', 'false');
          });
          pill.classList.add('is-selected');
          pill.setAttribute('aria-pressed', 'true');
          apply();
        });
      });

      apply();
    })();
  </script>

  {% comment %} ---------- delivery estimate + live perks ---------- {% endcomment %}
  <script>
    (function () {
      var root = document.getElementById('ShPdp-{{ product.id }}');
      if (!root || root.dataset.shLiveInit) return;
      root.dataset.shLiveInit = '1';

      var MONEY_FORMAT = {{ shop.money_format | strip_html | json }};
      var MET_TEXT = {{ PERK_MET_TEXT | json }};
      var ALWAYS_TEXT = {{ PERK_ALWAYS_TEXT | json }};

      /* ---- delivery estimate + countdown, Karachi time (UTC+5, no DST) ---- */
      var eta = root.querySelector('[data-sh-eta]');
      if (eta) {
        var MON = ['Jan','Feb','Mar','Apr','May','Jun','Jul','Aug','Sep','Oct','Nov','Dec'];
        var PKT = 5 * 3600 * 1000;
        var minD = parseInt(eta.dataset.min, 10) || 2;
        var maxD = parseInt(eta.dataset.max, 10) || 4;
        var procD = parseInt(eta.dataset.process, 10);
        if (isNaN(procD)) procD = 1;
        var cutoff = parseInt(eta.dataset.cutoff, 10);
        if (isNaN(cutoff) || cutoff < 1 || cutoff > 24) cutoff = 24;

        var q = function (s) { return eta.querySelector(s); };
        var pad = function (n) { return (n < 10 ? '0' : '') + n; };
        var day = function (base, n) { return new Date(base + n * 86400000); };
        var short = function (d) { return MON[d.getUTCMonth()] + ' ' + d.getUTCDate(); };
        var full = function (d) { return pad(d.getUTCDate()) + '/' + pad(d.getUTCMonth() + 1) + '/' + d.getUTCFullYear(); };
        var range = function (a, b) {
          if (a.getTime() === b.getTime()) return short(a);
          return a.getUTCMonth() === b.getUTCMonth()
            ? short(a) + ' - ' + b.getUTCDate()
            : short(a) + ' - ' + short(b);
        };

        var renderEta = function () {
          var pk = Date.now() + PKT;
          var midnight = Math.floor(pk / 86400000) * 86400000;
          var cut = midnight + cutoff * 3600000;
          var base = midnight;
          if (pk >= cut) { cut += 86400000; base += 86400000; }

          var left = Math.max(0, cut - pk);
          var h = Math.floor(left / 3600000);
          var m = Math.floor((left % 3600000) / 60000);

          var d0 = day(base, 0);
          var pEnd = day(base, Math.max(0, Math.min(procD, minD - 1)));
          var dA = day(base, minD);
          var dB = day(base, maxD);

          q('[data-eta-s1]').textContent = short(d0);
          q('[data-eta-s2]').textContent = range(d0, pEnd);
          q('[data-eta-s3]').textContent = range(dA, dB);
        };
        renderEta();
        setInterval(renderEta, 30000);
      }

      /* ---- money ---- */
      function num(n, dec, th, ds) {
        var p = n.toFixed(dec).split('.');
        p[0] = p[0].replace(/\B(?=(\d{3})+(?!\d))/g, th);
        return p.join(ds);
      }
      function money(cents) {
        var v = cents / 100;
        return MONEY_FORMAT.replace(/\{\{\s*(\w+)\s*\}\}/, function (_, k) {
          switch (k) {
            case 'amount_no_decimals': return num(v, 0, ',', '.');
            case 'amount_with_comma_separator': return num(v, 2, '.', ',');
            case 'amount_no_decimals_with_comma_separator': return num(v, 0, '.', ',');
            default: return num(v, 2, ',', '.').replace(/\.00$/, '');
          }
        });
      }

      /* ---- perks ---- */
      var perks = root.querySelectorAll('[data-sh-perk]');
      var perksCard = root.querySelector('[data-sh-perks-card]');
      var perksMsg = root.querySelector('[data-sh-perks-msg]');
      var perksFill = root.querySelector('[data-sh-perks-fill]');
      var AWAY_TEXT = {{ PERKS_AWAY_TEXT | json }};
      var ALL_TEXT = {{ PERKS_ALL_TEXT | json }};
      var esc = function (s) { var d = document.createElement('div'); d.textContent = s; return d.innerHTML; };
      function paint(subtotal) {
        var nextMin = 0, nextLabel = '';
        perks.forEach(function (el) {
          var m = parseInt(el.dataset.min, 10) || 0;
          if (m > subtotal && (nextMin === 0 || m < nextMin)) { nextMin = m; nextLabel = el.dataset.label || ''; }
        });
        if (perksCard) perksCard.classList.toggle('is-complete', nextMin === 0);
        if (perksMsg) {
          perksMsg.innerHTML = nextMin === 0
            ? '<strong>' + esc(ALL_TEXT) + '</strong>'
            : '<strong>' + esc(money(Math.ceil((nextMin - subtotal) / 100) * 100)) + '</strong> ' + esc(AWAY_TEXT) + ' <strong>' + esc(nextLabel) + '</strong>';
        }
        if (perksFill) perksFill.style.setProperty('--sh-progress', (nextMin === 0 ? 100 : Math.min(100, Math.floor(subtotal * 100 / nextMin))) + '%');
        perks.forEach(function (el) {
          var min = parseInt(el.dataset.min, 10) || 0;
          var met = subtotal >= min;
          el.classList.toggle('is-met', met);
          var st = el.querySelector('[data-sh-perk-status]');
          if (!st) return;
          if (min === 0) st.textContent = ALWAYS_TEXT;
          else if (met) st.textContent = MET_TEXT;
          else st.textContent = 'Add ' + money(Math.ceil((min - subtotal) / 100) * 100) + ' more';
        });
      }

      /* ---- product price x quantity ---- */
      var unitPrice = parseInt(root.dataset.price, 10) || {{ current_variant.price | default: 0 }};
      var unitCompare = {{ current_variant.compare_at_price | default: 0 }};
      var saveRow = root.querySelector('[data-sh-save]');
      var saveAmt = root.querySelector('[data-sh-save-amount]');
      function paintSave(q) {
        if (!saveRow) return;
        var per = unitCompare > unitPrice ? unitCompare - unitPrice : 0;
        saveRow.hidden = per <= 0;
        if (per > 0 && saveAmt) saveAmt.textContent = money(per * q);
      }
      var QTY_SEL = 'product-form-component input[name="quantity"], .product-form input[name="quantity"], form[action*="/cart/add"] input[name="quantity"]:not([type="hidden"])';
      function qty() {
        var el = document.querySelector(QTY_SEL);
        var n = el ? parseInt(el.value, 10) : 1;
        return n > 0 ? n : 1;
      }
      function update() { var q = qty(); paint(unitPrice * q); paintSave(q); }

      if (perks.length) {
        root.addEventListener('sheene:variant', function (e) {
          if (e.detail && e.detail.price != null) unitPrice = e.detail.price;
          if (e.detail && e.detail.compare != null) unitCompare = e.detail.compare;
          update();
        });
        var qTimer;
        function onQtyEvent(e) {
          var t = e.target;
          if (!t || !t.closest) return;
          if (t.matches && t.matches('input[name="quantity"]') || t.closest('quantity-selector-component, .quantity-selector, .quantity')) {
            clearTimeout(qTimer);
            qTimer = setTimeout(update, 30);
          }
        }
        document.addEventListener('input', onQtyEvent);
        document.addEventListener('change', onQtyEvent);
        document.addEventListener('click', onQtyEvent);
        update();
      }
    })();
  </script>
{% endif %}


{% comment %} ================================================================
     GOES WELL WITH / RECOMMEND INSTEAD
   ================================================================ {% endcomment %}
{% if part == 'goes_well' %}
  {% liquid
  assign refer_list = product.metafields.custom.pp_refer_products.value
  assign gww_list = product.metafields.custom.goes_well_products.value

  assign mode = ''
  if refer_list != blank and refer_list.size > 0
    assign mode = 'refer'
    assign items = refer_list
    assign heading = product.metafields.custom.pp_refer_heading.value | default: REFER_HEADING
    assign note = product.metafields.custom.pp_refer_note.value
  elsif gww_list != blank and gww_list.size > 0
    assign mode = 'gww'
    assign items = gww_list
    assign heading = GWW_HEADING
  endif
  %}

{% if mode != blank %}
  <div class="sh-gww sh-gww--{{ mode }}" id="ShGww-{{ product.id }}">
    <div class="sh-gww-label">{{ heading | escape }}</div>
    {% if mode == 'refer' and note != blank %}
      <p class="sh-gww-note">{{ note | escape }}</p>
    {% endif %}

    {% for item in items limit: MAX_ITEMS %}
      {% liquid
        assign iv = item.selected_or_first_available_variant | default: item.variants.first
        assign item_title = item.title | escape
        assign item_on_sale = false
        if iv.compare_at_price > iv.price
          assign item_on_sale = true
        endif
        assign multi = false
        if item.variants.size > 1
          assign multi = true
        endif
      %}

      <div class="sh-gww-card">
        <a href="{{ item.url }}" class="sh-gww-image">
          {% if item.featured_image %}
            {{ item.featured_image | image_url: width: 300 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: item_title, sizes: '120px', widths: '120,180,240,300' }}
          {% endif %}
        </a>

        <div class="sh-gww-details">
          <div class="sh-gww-price">
            <span class="sh-gww-price-current" data-current-price>{{ iv.price | money }}</span>
            <span class="sh-gww-price-compare" data-compare-price {% unless item_on_sale %}hidden{% endunless %}>{{ iv.compare_at_price | money }}</span>
          </div>

          <a href="{{ item.url }}" class="sh-gww-title">{{ item.title }}</a>

          {% if mode == 'refer' %}
            <a href="{{ item.url }}" class="sh-gww-add sh-gww-add--link">{{ REFER_BUTTON }}</a>
          {% else %}
            {% if multi %}
              <div class="sh-gww-variants">
                {% for v in item.variants %}
                  <button
                    type="button"
                    class="sh-gww-variant-btn"
                    data-variant-id="{{ v.id }}"
                    data-price="{{ v.price | money | escape }}"
                    data-compare="{{ v.compare_at_price | money | escape }}"
                    data-on-sale="{% if v.compare_at_price > v.price %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}"
                    {% unless v.available %}disabled{% endunless %}
                  >{{ v.title }}</button>
                {% endfor %}
              </div>
            {% endif %}

            <button
              type="button"
              class="sh-gww-add{% if multi %} needs-selection{% endif %}"
              data-add-to-cart
              data-variant-id="{{ iv.id }}"
              {% unless item.available %}disabled{% endunless %}
            >
              {% if item.available == false %}{{ SOLD_OUT_TEXT }}{% elsif multi %}{{ SELECT_TEXT }}{% else %}{{ ADD_TEXT }}{% endif %}
            </button>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>

  <style>
    /* mobile: Custom Liquid block ka wrapper content jitna sikur jata hai,
       is liye box aadha reh jata tha. Wrapper ko poori width do. */
    @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
      *:has(> .sh-gww) {
        width: 100% !important;
        max-width: 100% !important;
        align-self: stretch !important;
      }
    }
    .sh-gww {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      width: 100%;
      border: 1px solid rgb(var(--color-border-rgb, 17 17 17) / 0.22);
      padding: clamp(1rem, 0.85rem + 0.5vw, 1.5rem);
      margin: clamp(0.5rem, 0.4rem + 0.4vw, 1rem) 0;
      font-family: var(--font-body--family, system-ui, sans-serif);
      color: var(--color-foreground, #111111);
    }
    .sh-gww-label {
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: clamp(0.75rem, 0.7rem + 0.15vw, 0.85rem);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      padding-bottom: clamp(0.75rem, 0.6rem + 0.4vw, 1.1rem);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-foreground, #111111);
      margin-bottom: clamp(0.9rem, 0.75rem + 0.4vw, 1.25rem);
    }
    .sh-gww-note {
      margin: -0.35rem 0 1rem;
      font-size: clamp(0.88rem, 0.84rem + 0.12vw, 0.95rem);
      color: rgb(var(--color-foreground-rgb, 17 17 17) / 0.65);
    }
    .sh-gww-card {
      display: flex;
      gap: clamp(0.85rem, 0.7rem + 0.4vw, 1.25rem);
      align-items: flex-start;
    }
    .sh-gww-card + .sh-gww-card {
      margin-top: clamp(0.9rem, 0.75rem + 0.4vw, 1.25rem);
      padding-top: clamp(0.9rem, 0.75rem + 0.4vw, 1.25rem);
      border-top: 1px solid var(--color-foreground, #111111);
    }
    .sh-gww-image {
      flex: 0 0 clamp(88px, 70px + 5vw, 140px);
      display: block;
      background: #F2F2F0;
    }
    .sh-gww-image img {
      width: 100%;
      aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
      object-fit: cover;
      display: block;
    }
    .sh-gww-details {
      flex: 1 1 0;
      min-width: 0;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: clamp(0.35rem, 0.3rem + 0.15vw, 0.55rem);
    }
    .sh-gww-price { display: flex; align-items: baseline; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem; }
    .sh-gww-price-current { font-weight: 600; font-size: clamp(1rem, 0.92rem + 0.3vw, 1.2rem); }
    .sh-gww-price-compare {
      font-size: clamp(0.85rem, 0.8rem + 0.15vw, 0.95rem);
      color: rgb(var(--color-foreground-rgb, 17 17 17) / 0.45);
      text-decoration: line-through;
    }
    .sh-gww-price-compare[hidden] { display: none; }
    .sh-gww-title {
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: clamp(0.95rem, 0.88rem + 0.25vw, 1.1rem);
      line-height: 1.25;
      color: inherit;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    .sh-gww-variants { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.4rem; }
    .sh-gww-variant-btn {
      background: none;
      border: 1px solid rgb(var(--color-border-rgb, 17 17 17) / 0.25);
      border-radius: 4px;
      padding: 0.45rem 0.7rem;
      font: inherit;
      font-size: clamp(0.78rem, 0.75rem + 0.1vw, 0.86rem);
      color: inherit;
      cursor: pointer;
      min-height: 36px;
    }
    .sh-gww-variant-btn.is-active { border-color: var(--color-foreground, #111111); box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--color-foreground, #111111); font-weight: 600; }
    .sh-gww-variant-btn:disabled { opacity: 0.4; cursor: not-allowed; text-decoration: line-through; }

    .sh-gww-add {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      width: 100%;
      min-height: 44px;
      margin-top: 0.2rem;
      padding: 0.7rem 1rem;
      background: var(--color-foreground, #111111);
      color: var(--color-background, #FFFFFF);
      font: inherit;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: clamp(0.9rem, 0.85rem + 0.15vw, 1rem);
      border: 0;
      border-radius: 0;
      text-decoration: none;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
    }
    .sh-gww-add:disabled { opacity: 0.5; cursor: not-allowed; }
    .sh-gww-add:not(:disabled):hover { opacity: 0.85; }
    .sh-gww-add.needs-selection { background: transparent; color: var(--color-foreground, #111111); box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--color-foreground, #111111); }
  </style>

  {% if mode == 'gww' %}
    <script>
      (function () {
        var root = document.getElementById('ShGww-{{ product.id }}');
        if (!root || root.dataset.shInit) return;
        root.dataset.shInit = '1';
        var ADD_TEXT = {{ ADD_TEXT | json }};

        root.querySelectorAll('.sh-gww-card').forEach(function (card) {
          var vBtns = card.querySelectorAll('.sh-gww-variant-btn');
          var add = card.querySelector('[data-add-to-cart]');
          var cur = card.querySelector('[data-current-price]');
          var cmp = card.querySelector('[data-compare-price]');

          vBtns.forEach(function (btn) {
            btn.addEventListener('click', function () {
              if (btn.disabled) return;
              vBtns.forEach(function (b) { b.classList.remove('is-active'); });
              btn.classList.add('is-active');
              cur.textContent = btn.dataset.price;
              cmp.textContent = btn.dataset.compare;
              cmp.hidden = btn.dataset.onSale !== 'true';
              add.dataset.variantId = btn.dataset.variantId;
              add.textContent = ADD_TEXT;
              add.classList.remove('needs-selection');
            });
          });

          if (!add) return;
          add.addEventListener('click', function () {
            if (add.disabled || add.classList.contains('needs-selection')) return;
            var label = add.textContent;
            add.disabled = true;
            add.textContent = 'Adding...';
            fetch('/cart/add.js', {
              method: 'POST',
              headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json', Accept: 'application/json' },
              body: JSON.stringify({ items: [{ id: add.dataset.variantId, quantity: 1 }] })
            })
              .then(function (r) { if (!r.ok) throw new Error(); return r.json(); })
              .then(function () { add.textContent = 'Added'; window.location.reload(); })
              .catch(function () {
                add.textContent = label;
                add.disabled = false;
                alert('Could not add this to your cart. Please try again.');
              });
          });
        });
      })();
    </script>
  {% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
